<title>USA: Republic Industries to buy dealerships.</title>
<headline>Republic Industries to buy dealerships.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Republic Industries Inc said Monday it would buy Ed Mullinax Inc in a stock transaction worth about $100 million.</p>
<p>Republic said it will issue about $100 million of common stock at the transaction's close, expected in early 1997.</p>
<p>Ed Mullinax owns and operates five Ford and Lincoln-Mercury dealerships in northeast Ohio and southern Florida.</p>
<p>A spokesman from Republic said the acquisition would be additive to Republic's earnings, although did not say by how much.</p>
</text>
